OL,3,GNEWSA'Brunel spinning in grave' -
OL,4,ABristol's bridge crisis
OL,5,
OL,6,FBristol is famous for its bridges -
OL,7,Ffrom the iconic Clifton Suspension
OL,8,FBridge to others in its thriving
OL,9,Ffloating harbour - but recently they
OL,10,Fhave made headlines for the wrong
OL,11,Freasons after Pero's Bridge collapsed
OL,12,Finto the water.
OL,14,FThe council has faced accusations of
OL,15,Fmismanagement as opposition councillors
OL,16,Fcall for greater transparency over
OL,17,Faction to fix the city's "crumbling"
OL,18,Finfrastructure.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
