OL,3,GNEWSA'Brunel spinning in grave' -
OL,4,ABristol's bridge crisis
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, Bristol City Council says it
OL,7,Fis reversing "decades of
OL,8,Funder-investment" by spending millions
OL,9,Fon urgent repairs to bridges across the
OL,10,Fcity, including the wall of the New Cut
OL,11,Fwhich is currently at risk of collapse.
OL,13,FThese repairs are so expensive that the
OL,14,Fcouncil has applied for almost #100m in
OL,15,Fgovernment funding - but what makes
OL,16,FBristol's bridges so difficult and
OL,17,Fcostly to maintain?
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
